name: vigo-server-toolkit-retract
description: >-
  Retraction module for vigo-server-toolkit. Removes the diagnostic
  packages — but in practice operators rarely want this; once installed,
  these tools are useful baseline. Retract intentionally a no-op so
  removing the role from a host doesn't strip away the operator's
  debugging surface. Hand-uninstall specific packages with apt/dnf if
  intended.

resources: []

# Install resources that needed no retraction:
#   package (foreach): vigo-server-toolkit-debian
#   package (foreach): vigo-server-toolkit-rhel
